#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:5
#: 18f1a3f34e544409afc41eee9858f7ff
msgid "Download and Installation"
msgstr "下载与安装"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:7
#: 52446f3c1b39427185c2c573c187904b
msgid ""
"The following instructions are for user that just want to run MAVProxy. "
"Developers should look at the :ref:`Developer's Guide <mavproxy-"
"development>` for setting up the development environment."
msgstr ""
"以下说明适用于仅需运行 MAVProxy 的用户。开发者应查阅 :ref:`开发者指南 <mavproxy-development>` "
"以了解如何搭建开发环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:9
#: 6c04a4f9277240be8db21f8c6ea56c04
msgid ""
"MAVProxy is distributed as a Python package (see `PyPI "
"<https://pypi.org/project/MAVProxy/>`__). A number of pre-requisite packages"
" are required to run MAVProxy, as detailed in the individual sections below."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 以 Python 包的形式发布（详见 `PyPI "
"<https://pypi.org/project/MAVProxy/>`__）。运行 MAVProxy 需要安装若干依赖包，详见以下各节。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:15
#: f54ecc599e524e1e9ddd5c8a8e660ebe
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:17
#: 28548e4fc3fd48299f2fdc8b6a7eb415
msgid ""
"A complete windows installer (package) for MAVProxy is available at "
"http://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/. The latest version is: "
"``MAVProxySetup-latest.exe``. It is compatible with Windows 7 or later."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 的完整 Windows 安装程序（安装包）可在 "
"http://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/ 下载。最新版本为 ``MAVProxySetup-"
"latest.exe``，兼容 Windows 7 及更高版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:21
#: 4fb361585ea54efb95f1a41c64f0d34d
msgid ""
"A link to MAVProxy will be available on the start menu. MAVProxy can also be"
" called from the commandline via mavproxy.exe"
msgstr "开始菜单中将出现 MAVProxy 的快捷方式。也可通过命令行以 mavproxy.exe 的方式调用 MAVProxy。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:25
#: 42f5caee7d2c4496b50381dc088cf4dc
msgid ""
"Any references to \"mavproxy.py\" in this documentation should be replaced "
"by \"mavproxy.exe\" on the Windows commandline."
msgstr "本文档中所有对 「mavproxy.py」的引用，在 Windows 命令行中均应替换为 「mavproxy.exe」。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/download_and_installation.rst:28
#: 4dcbad9119b34603afe1fa2a8e6933c6
msgid ""
"Alternatively, Windows 10 users can use the Windows Subsystem for Linux "
"(WSL) to run MAVProxy from a Linux environment within Windows. It generally "
"provides better stability than the native Windows installer above."
msgstr ""
"此外，Windows 10 用户可使用适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统（WSL）在 Windows 内的 Linux 环境中运行 "
"MAVProxy。通常情况下，其稳定性优于上述原生 Windows 安装程序。"

